 class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEje9Vlz4rN-TYWv9BUPffFtFQbItr-CZi4XCx0FSbtJI1gFKMqojt9hF3Sds6zDiAlc1y4EFoYlutGsOuf8Xd-48jydB7FQnGkZ27o1CrzGCkos3Ij-ZgyPoAJD493X_F0pI-iWYixOt-IrMHIAhW4F3A4QnhlUl24SZDfoqA6aC4svUBMbu6vqY414eJsj\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEje9Vlz4rN-TYWv9BUPffFtFQbItr-CZi4XCx0FSbtJI1gFKMqojt9hF3Sds6zDiAlc1y4EFoYlutGsOuf8Xd-48jydB7FQnGkZ27o1CrzGCkos3Ij-ZgyPoAJD493X_F0pI-iWYixOt-IrMHIAhW4F3A4QnhlUl24SZDfoqA6aC4svUBMbu6vqY414eJsj=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh1S_7pTgdUCy2Td6NkIVickJmR6IgID2Cy13iuPbE6-OHLhsSNvR4tkW1M-hJORzuSCD4p32PSCmkWjF5AAsvJmpMkxwH6H7k2fRGNuvexwLjaHS6DkZsnwmOD24HG7EVWkrWwYhBzLbdWqFdQNiobNl9FhDAC5rbDGic8MY8h3iTUEDp-GNTC3vt0cmLy\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"729\" data-original-width=\"516\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh1S_7pTgdUCy2Td6NkIVickJmR6IgID2Cy13iuPbE6-OHLhsSNvR4tkW1M-hJORzuSCD4p32PSCmkWjF5AAsvJmpMkxwH6H7k2fRGNuvexwLjaHS6DkZsnwmOD24HG7EVWkrWwYhBzLbdWqFdQNiobNl9FhDAC5rbDGic8MY8h3iTUEDp-GNTC3vt0cmLy=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div><br /></div></div></div></div><div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;一目nih仔冬天就到--ah，寒流一下到位，sì-kè變kah冷ki-ki，活beh寒--死。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tsit个寒天tsiânn無平靜，代先是我ê《台灣好tshit-thô》兩本創刊號ē-sái再版，逐家lóng tsiok歡喜，啥人知《台南古城》hit本無問題，《蘭嶼風情》一下印好suah hōo翰翔hit爿發現蘭嶼豬仔ê身軀邊有一tshok血。Tsit聲代誌大條--ah，透早王董--ê就khà來叫楊總--ê&nbsp;ài負責，楊總--ê隨huah我入去問。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「無可能！Hit工樣稿我有確定--過，而且華藝送--tńg-來ê光碟內底圖mā無koh-iūnn……」阿洲排版一向tsiânn頂真，我也有再三檢查--過，哪ē出現tsit款tîng-tânn--neh？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">後--來楊總--ê叫我過去華藝直接查電腦內ê原版畫面，伊tsit-má就趕去印刷廠了解情形。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我ê冊拄仔送入去印無三工niā-niā，上班時間koh雄雄走--來，害吳副總驚一tiô。尾--à確定in電腦內ê檔案mā無問題，阮逐家tsiah笑ē出--來。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「我對阿洲有信心，尤其koh是你ê冊，伊哪ē敢無斟酌--leh？」黃姊講。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;「若是hit箍小秦--ā上兩光，見擺to thut-tshuê，lín楊總--ê按怎賠m̄驚？Tsit款跤siàu若我，早就hòo-hìnn-sak！」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「小秦--ā是有khah散仙，m̄-koh人伊mā tsiânn拚勢，huah加班就加班，lóng無第二句話。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「He是因為伊愛kah lín tsia-ê查某囡仔米糕siûnn……」副總--ê無kah意小秦--ā，因為hit箍白目猴tiānn呵咾黃姊面肉幼、體格suí，講in姍姍種著老母tsiah ē tsiah-nī古錐koh得人疼，意思m̄就是嫌副總--ê生做bái。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">小秦--ā hit支喙上hiau-hīng，若一工無khue查某囡仔心肝真礙虐。逐擺看著經理，伊ē講：「你tsiah suí，若減十歲我beh娶tńg來做某，哪ē輪著楊總--ê？」Sù常對秋雯講：「嫁hōo--我，我ē kā你ê囝疼命命！」Hit工，koh kā我講：「頭一擺看著你，就知你是我未來ê牽手。」我tsiah無hiah衰，嫁hōo tsit pān--ê！其實阮lóng知伊烏白講，聽聽--leh準拄煞，無人beh kā信táu。Kan-na如萍khah少歲，聽久小可ē「hîn船」。桂英爸母不時tī公司出出入入，伊可能驚ē hōo人舂，iáu m̄ bat聽過伊對桂英講tsia-ê a-sa-puh-luh ê話。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">落尾--à hōo楊總--ê查出是印刷廠hit爿thut-tshuê，工人tī印刷ê時無細膩去bak著紅色墨水——好佳哉，參阮無關係！</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">自從我tńg來做tsit套旅遊冊了後，kah一堆tsiânn有名ê攝影師合作，親像山嶽專家山楊--ā老師、生態研究員吉仔哥、民俗專家黃百川老師、賞鳥專家兼畫家何人豪老師……in lóng是hit方面ê專家，用相片記錄lán台灣tsit塊土地頂頭上美麗ê光景、上溫暖ê人情味。其中黃老師是一个國際導遊，m̄-nā對台灣ê民俗祭典kài有研究，伊koh tshuā團規世界走透透，去過80幾个國家，hip六百幾場ê文化祭典。我ê兩本創刊號lóng是用伊ê相片，我hām黃老師ē-sái講是「英雄惜英雄」，我kah意伊ê鏡頭，伊欣賞我ê文字。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">有時仔看做囡仔冊hit四个編輯bē輸hōo人關tī鳥籠仔底，為著tsit個月ē-tàng順利出刊拚kah大粒汗細粒汗，一下無拄好，suah ài攑刀sio刣，刣kah刀刀見骨。想當初我看m̄是勢緊來走是tio̍h--ê。若無，tsit久iáu關tī hia做giàn頭，kah hia-ê人tak久suah變做一隻sio拍雞仔，he就害--ah！</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">近來，阮經理買一支股票大起，趁bē少錢。拜六下晡，伊招明翰、華藝所有ê人做伙去陽明山浸溫泉，順suà食tshenn-tshau。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">桂英老母心臟換電池leh蹛院，秋雯ê後生學校有活動，in兩个無參加。如萍講昨暝睏無好，規个人se̍h神se̍h神，kan-na我上無閒，liam-mi ài陪經理kah黃姊開講，liam-mi tio̍h kah楊琳、姍姍sńg，bē輸一粒干樂leh舞kah lin-long-se̍h。講實在--ê，我khah kah意參兩个囡仔鬥陣，因為hit兩个查某人siunn關心我ê終身大事，hōo我感覺壓力tsiânn大。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「Lán好來去tshuân洗身軀--ah，m̄-thang hōo in等，若無，副總--ê&nbsp;hit支喙又koh tī hia se̍h-se̍h唸，tsiânn煩！」黃姊看一下仔時間，催逐家講。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阮查某--ê洗好了後，出來溫泉會館大廳等in查埔beh做伙去食暗，等規半晡就是等無人，khà手機仔也lóng無接，m̄知in到底leh pìnn啥mih báng？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「外口有人leh sio拍……」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「Tsit-má ê少年仔kha̍p-bē著就起跤動手，若m̄是為著錢，百面是為著情。」經理ná講ná幌頭。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「阿洲哥哥！」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「Mài烏白講！阿洲哥哥哪ē kah人結冤仇？」黃姊叫是姍姍囡仔人目睭看tānn--去。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">一tak久仔，副總--ê青磅白磅tsông倚來講：「M̄好--ah！楊總--ê去hōo一陣穿烏衫ê少年家押走--去。」Tsit-má阿洲kah小秦--ā tuè穿烏衫--ê ê尾後去看māi，黃經理參余大兄tī路頭等警察來，副總--ê先走來kā阮通報。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「押uì佗位去？」經理隨叫副總--ê&nbsp;tshuā路，伊beh家己去看māi，bē赴等到警察來。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">眾人勸伊mài tshóng-pōng，經理tsiah無愛tshap hiah濟，「救人要緊！」看伊走kánn-ná飛--leh。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Suà--落-來，楊琳煩惱in爸爸hōo歹人掠--去，tī hia一直哭、一直哭，sian騙騙bē恬，hōo伊哭kah逐家心情亂操操。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「A̍h無人beh接電話，tsit-tsūn到底是按怎？活beh急--死！」逐家等kah心狂火to̍h，lóng bē記得iáu未食飯，kan-na希望in ē-tàng平安無代誌。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">過tsiânn點鐘久，我ê手機仔tân--ah。是副總--ê提阿洲ê手機仔khà--過-來，伊講逐家lóng無代誌，in tng tī派出所做筆錄，叫阮免煩惱先去食暗，in khah停仔就ē tńg來kah阮會合。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">楊琳聽著in爸爸平安，伊tsiah huah腹肚iau。姍姍khah天真，伊講：「人我ê爸爸是『鹹蛋超人』，hia-ê歹人lóng mā驚--伊，m̄敢掠--伊！」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">黃姊笑講：「Lín爸爸是一个大箍呆，siunn重--ah，hia-ê歹人掠伊無法--leh！」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">尾--à in就來揣--阮，順suà駛車載阮來tńg。Tī車底，如萍偷偷kā我講：「Lán三个大人mā真害，明明有兩台車tī hia，偏偏仔無人ē-hiáu駛。」伊講伊想beh去學駛車，親像經理án-ne，做一个有能力、有擔當ê新時代女性。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">經理kioh-siàu上好，今仔日楊總--ê平安倒tńg--來，伊ê功勞上kài大。聽講楊總--à hōo人押入去一間鐵厝內底，阿洲in m̄敢倚--過-去，kan-na tī外口等警察來。經理一下到位，隨衝入去問hia-ê人：「光頭白日，lín kám是揣m̄-tio̍h人？Lán也無冤無仇，lín掠伊來beh創啥？」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">原來hia-ê人並無掠m̄-tio̍h人，in是刁工來揣楊總--ê，為著——感情代。Tshuā頭ê烏松是阮公司樓跤pháng店阿妹仔ê未婚夫，因為發現一直有人kah伊ê未婚妻膏膏纏，hōo伊khí-moo tsiânn bái，尾後探聽出來tsit个m̄-tsiânn人就是阮出版社ê員工，伊tsiah決定làu人來拜託楊總--à kā家己tshiànn ê人管hōo好。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「就án-ne？伊哪ē無愛去揣hit个m̄-tsiânn人？Tse hām楊總--ê啥tī代？」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「楊筱雅，你tsit个查某哪ē tsiah甕肚？若我hōo人押走，你kám lóng bē心疼？」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「小秦--ā，你hit支喙死to bē改！你是beh koh惹偌濟麻煩？」如萍tih-beh hōo伊氣--死，余大兄mā kā伊罵kah無一tè好。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「我a̍h無按怎？Hit个阿妹仔家己想siunn濟，tse參我啥tī代？我凊彩講講--leh，伊叫是家己khah suí面，親像伊hit款貨色我iáu看bē tsiūnn目！Koh再講，lán公司suí查某滿滿是，我哪tio̍h去phānn--伊--neh？」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">楊總--ê翁仔某腹腸有夠闊，一點仔to無怪小秦--ā。經理有警告伊後擺講話ài khah細膩--leh，m̄-thang koh痟話講規擔。楊總--ê講：「人食喙水，魚食流水。」少年人jiok查某囡仔就是án-ne生，以後khah謹慎--leh就好。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Tńg到厝，我想起tú-tsiah kánn-ná看著阿洲ê額頭有tio̍h傷，傳一个簡訊去kā問看māi：「學長，你ê頭殼kám有要緊？Ài保重！筱雅」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">一睏仔，伊回講：「皮肉傷無要緊。本底tsiânn疼，m̄-koh有你ê關心，好真濟--ah。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">愛滾sńg笑！我a̍h m̄是醫生，án-ne生a̍h有效？我koh kā伊問講：「你哪ē去掃著風颱尾？」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「對方棍仔一下but--來，我閃無離suah去kiat著頭。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「有糊藥仔--無？明仔載若無khah好，tio̍h去hōo醫生看。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「我ē照顧家己，請你放心！」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">我想講有kā關心就好，mài koh討債電話錢，而且伊án-ne回，我真正接bē落--去--ah。煞煞--去，來大廳陪阿母看電視mā khah贏。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Beh睏ê時，我發現手機仔內有一个新訊息，是阿洲傳--來--ê：「今仔日tī警察局ê時，一下看手機仔有12通你khà--來無接--著ê電話，hōo我感覺心內tsiok燒lō。原來也是有人要緊我ê安危！見擺看副總--ê無接著黃姊ê電話hōo人罵，我to tsiok欣羨--伊……」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">冤枉--啊，電話是黃姊叫我khà</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">--ê！因為黃姊臆講副總--</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">&nbsp;hit支老古董『大哥大』定著koh無電--ah，楊總--</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">ê</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">、余大兄in lóng無接，阮就隨个仔khà看māi，看啥人有閒kā阮回報消息。我mā有khà hōo黃經理、小秦--ā，tsit箍阿洲kám bē想siunn濟？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">拜一寒流koh來報到，寒kah kan-na想beh bih tī厝內，佗位mā無愛去。阿洲來招我鬥陣食晝，經理直直鼓吹阮去大樹跤食火鍋，為著mài辜負in ê心意，我姑不將tsiah出門。我真正tsiok想beh留tī辦公室食泡麵，食好睏半點鐘久繼續上班，in掠準我是驚歹勢刁工án-ne講。可見in iáu是無夠了解--我，我kám是hit款iau鬼假細膩ê人？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">阿洲問我離開明翰文化hit八個外月leh創啥，我就照實講：「先tuè人去做推銷員賣冊，賣無三工就放棄--ah。Tang時仔寫冊、做冊、看冊我ē-hiáu，賣冊suah賣無路來，正經是一款人食一款飯。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「聽黃姊講你m̄是也有去做編劇？」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「後--來我看著有人leh應徵寫劇本，一時手ngiau幾個月無寫作--ah，就去試一下仔手氣，無想--著竟然有錄取。就án-ne我離開行銷公司，走去做編劇。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">伊koh問我寫劇本ê代誌。我是hōo阿母罵kah驚--去，tsiah決定beh離職--ê。因為阿母是一个標準ê八點檔戲迷，聽講我beh去做編劇，伊比啥人lóng koh-khah歡喜，逐改我ná寫、伊tī hia ná提供意見，寫好koh ài唸hōo伊聽。伊若看我kā好人寫寫--死，hōo歹人leh tshàng鬚，ē愈看愈凝，有時氣kah叫我規氣辭辭--leh，講寫tsit款劇本ē有報應，天公伯mā看bē落。Án-ne世間ê天理tī佗位？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">其實我家己mā無法度做主，阮編劇是七个人一組同齊編故事，然後一人負責寫一集，寫--ê bē輸雜菜麵仝款，亂使摻、烏白lām，一點仔思想to無，koh-khah免講是公道iah是天理！</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">講半晡，伊雄雄問--我：「你kám有男朋友？」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「Tse……beh按怎講？我有kah意ê人，但是iáu無算是男朋友。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「你kah意啥mih款人？」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「老人。因為我自細漢是阿公阿媽飼大漢--ê，所以對老歲仔感覺khah親切……。」伊叫是我leh練痟話，m̄知我講ê逐句實在話。我就kā講阿風老師ê代誌，橫直bat--我ê人lóng知我kah意阿風老師。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">Ē記得有一回，伊教阮用Ho̍h-ló話讀白居易〈長恨歌〉：「在天願作比翼鳥，在地願為連理枝。天長地久有時盡，此恨綿綿無絕期。」我欣賞台頂迷人ê聲韻kah風采，一時suah看kah gāng--去。「筱雅，看課本！我ê面kám有寫字？」自hit擺以後，我sannh著阿風老師就變做一个通人知ê祕密--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">古早我tsiok欣羨助理ē-tàng逐工tuè tī伊ê身軀邊，就講：「等我畢業，beh做老師ê助理。」阿風老師隨pìnn面講：「無彩我tsiah用心教--你，就是ǹg望你後過hām我徛做伙，甚至是超過我……Siáng知你kan-na想beh做助理，真是hōo我太失望！」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「就án-ne你一定beh儉錢tńg去讀研究所？」阿洲問--我。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「規欉好好——無錯！」我想beh tuè阿風老師ê跤步，行伊行--過ê路，去到伊ê身軀邊，食kah伊仝款ê飯，做kah伊仝款ê夢……</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">「筱雅︐你tse是崇拜︐m̄是戀愛。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">M̄管--lah！至少到目前為止，我除了阿風老師以外，啥人mā看bē tsiūnn目。無的確有一日拄著koh-khah適合ê人，伊ē沓沓仔行入我ê心肝內，將阿風老師ê形影趕走--去；mā無定著我hām阿風老師就是性命中註定ài行sio倚ê人。Tse tio̍h看月下老人ê紅線按怎牽，mā m̄是我家己講--ê就有準算。</span></div></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">(後期繼續)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: center;\"><div style=\"font-weight: 400; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtA5u4OQb_Qhl5q2r99aRgS6aKK_ffPVom911metAlMvWjhnC7eRVuRvdAi-JYwGM7Kv5NwYeNdkjU8KywNl4TnmKLFayyu7KXUobnNYpeBcJi_oUfFxcS3gzUehqHADr_-1fWxkOwfySOO9cprCDdPa-Bk1I9ves5cKU6r6Bhaqq2P9NT5WHzXJsAkybW\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2139\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtA5u4OQb_Qhl5q2r99aRgS6aKK_ffPVom911metAlMvWjhnC7eRVuRvdAi-JYwGM7Kv5NwYeNdkjU8KywNl4TnmKLFayyu7KXUobnNYpeBcJi_oUfFxcS3gzUehqHADr_-1fWxkOwfySOO9cprCDdPa-Bk1I9ves5cKU6r6Bhaqq2P9NT5WHzXJsAkybW=w451-h640\" width=\"451\" /></a></div><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: medium;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #3778cd; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: currentcolor; padding: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration: none; touch-action: manipulation;\" tabindex=\"0\">#台文通訊BONG報</a></span><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> 381期，2025年12月出刊。</span></b></span></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helv